# worker/ is a separate service deployed on Railway (worker/Dockerfile), not
# part of this Vercel app. It has its own FastAPI `app` object and its own
# playwright dependency, which Vercel's Python zero-config builder was
# auto-detecting as an extra serverless function and trying to deploy inside
# this project — crashing with ModuleNotFoundError: No module named
# 'playwright' because playwright is intentionally not installed here.
worker/
